              "text": "<evidence id=\"E1\" sha256=\"c76e22d300970fb7264c53239da1d5bd3b5e8e30356f60629aff6355c7d67543\" kind=\"text\" label=\"scope evidence\">\nSeller: Luma Grove, Philippines\nBuyer: Neri Vale\nProduct: Shea butter skincare set\nPayment currency: INR\n\nAgreed requirements:\nSupply two 100 g jars of unscented shea body butter.\nInclude a printed ingredient card in the parcel.\nUse tamper-evident seals on both jars.\nSupply four 30 g shea lip balm tins.\n\nAgreed price:\nBody butter, two jars: INR 1,200\nLip balm, four tins: INR 600\nPacking and postage: INR 300\nTotal: INR 2,100\n\nThe buyer approved these specifications before payment. The seller will pack the items together and send the parcel by tracked courier.\n</evidence>"
